{title: To Chaand Raati}
{artist: Ajay Atul Shreya Ghoshal Chandramukhi}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D] To chand rati [E] tejal [D] tana,        [D] Hey prana majhe [E] ovala [D] tana
[D] Ka prita vedi lajate,        [D] Svasata venu va [E] jate
[Bm] Yetila hati te svarga sati,        [G] Ajanma [D] tu satha [B] de... [D]
[D] Tu jaratari katha ruperi,        [Bm] Mohara [E] lya pad [F#] racha
[D] Vyakulalelya ya dharanila,        [Bm] Shamal [E] megha [F#] sukhacha
[D] Jiva [E] udhal [D] la,        [D] aaj [E] tujhy [D] var
Takuni [Bm] ya kaat [C#] re.. [D],        [Bm] Yetila hati te svarga sati
[G] Ajanma [D] tu satha [B] de... [D],        [D] To chand rati [E] tejal [D] tana
[D] Hey prana majhe [E] ovala [D] tana
